  "abstract": "Turns the OWASP Top 10 for Agentic Applications 2026 (ASI01 to ASI10, Version 2026, December 2025) into a review workflow for AI agents and multi-agent systems. It has one version line, the 2026 edition, which is the first edition and has no preview. SKILL.md holds the least-agency invariants and the review workflow; references cover the version line, summarise each entry with its mitigations, give a checklist grouped by tool use, identity and privilege, human-in-the-loop and least agency, and map entries to the Agentic AI Threats and Mitigations taxonomy v1.1 and the LLM Top 10.",
